    an array ``eigvals``.

    - ``eigvals``: array of shape ``(..., N)`` containing the eigenvalues.
    - ``eigvecs``: array of shape ``(..., N, N)`` containing the eigenvectors.

  Raise:
    NotImplementedError: If `b` is not None.

  See also:
    - :func:`jax.numpy.linalg.eigh`: NumPy-style eigh API.
